INVERSION -- the amplitude PINS the mass (Psi0/M_red ~ m^-1/4):
  eps=1.24% (with c=1, f_amp=0.6)  =>  m = 2.24e-20 eV
  at that m:  Psi0 = 5.03e+16 GeV,  z_osc = 4.0e+07,  Psi0/M_red = 2.07%
----------------------------------------------------------------------
READS:
 * Psi0 ~ 1e17 GeV and Psi0/M_red are DERIVED from the DM abundance
   (leading-order misalignment; O(1) anharmonic/onset factors ~2x).
 * The amplitude is in the RIGHT DECADE by itself -- but hitting 1.24%
   exactly requires m ~ few x 1e-20 eV (heavier than the 1e-21 fuzzy-DM
   fiducial by ~20x).  So #11 + abundance => a MASS PIN (links to #9).
 * STILL OWED (needs WSL stiff ODE / loop): f_amp from the genesis orbit,
   c from the effective-action loop (#14), and the O(1) misalignment
   factors.  Those move the pinned m by factors, not orders.
